hearken-genny is a Rust port of the formant speech synthesizer in genny
(genny/speech.py): genny by Oriol Gómez (https://github.com/ogomez92/genny)
and blal1's fork of it (https://pypi.org/project/genny/).

Copyright (c) Oriol Gómez and blal1. All rights reserved.

The port is included in Hearken, and in games built with Hearken, with the
authors' permission. It is not covered by Hearken's MIT or Apache-2.0
licence. Ask the genny authors before using this code anywhere else.

The British accent rules (src/accent.rs) and the British vowels in
src/phonemes.rs were added for Hearken by Joshua Tubbs (Orinks).
